<p>Command your Temporal Hounds to breathe time, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> temporal damage and reducing the three highest stats of all targets in a radius <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> cone.</p><p>Affected targets will have their stats reduced by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">11, 13, 16, 17, 19</acronym> for 3 turns.  You are immune to the breath of your own hounds and your hounds are immune to stat damage from other hounds.</p><p>When you learn this talent, your hounds gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43%</acronym> temporal damage affinity.</p>